 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and complete: bodies stay unexposed with `(rfl)`-proved `_def` lemmas, every new predicate carries intro/elim plus its interaction lemmas, `private` is limited to argument-local machinery that public statements subsume, and the general sign/gap/squarefree facts are exported from their own modules. No compatibility artifacts, no duplicated declarations against Mathlib or the existing repo, and the degenerate-case lemmas carry `@[simp, grind =]`.",
